@host = http://localhost:5000

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin#2026!"
}

### Verificar MFA (el codigo se imprime en la consola del backend)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/mfa/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mfaToken": "REEMPLAZAR",
  "code": "REEMPLAZAR"
}

### Perfil (requiere Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>)
GET {{host}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer REEMPLAZAR

###
